# Streamlit UI

## Structure

- `streamlit_app.py` — entry point, routing, search sidebar
- `streamlit/views/` — page renderers (dossiers, carnet, graph, person, trash)
- `streamlit/services/backend.py` — direct imports from `backend/` (no HTTP)

## Navigation

Use `st.session_state.page` values: `dossiers`, `trash`, `dossier`, `carnet`, `graph`, `person`.

Store context IDs: `dossier_id`, `carnet_id`, `entity_id`.

## Conventions

- French UI text by default
- Dark theme via `.streamlit/config.toml`
- Graph visualization: PyVis + `st.components.v1.html`
- Provenance badges on entity cards (confidence, status)
- AI analysis always labeled as hypothesis

## Do not

- Call external APIs without provenance in transform results
- Auto-merge entities — suggestions only
- Log PII in Streamlit debug output
